<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed higher in heavy trading.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 26.71 to 8088.38, a record.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite rose 1.62 to 485.51, a record.</p>
<p>The average price per share was up $0.15.</p>
<p>Advancers beat decliners 1714 to 1152.</p>
<p>Volume was 616,934,430 compared with 579,560,870 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1630 EDT/2030 GMT).</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
